Third-party data

The aeronautical charts in public/charts/ and the data derived from them in
content/ are publications of DECEA (Departamento de Controle do Espaço Aéreo,
Brazil), obtained from AISWEB (https://aisweb.decea.mil.br). They are not
covered by the license above and remain the property of DECEA. They are
included for flight simulation reference only and must not be used for real
navigation.
